
## Contribution Guidelines

1. **Code Style**: Follow the Rust style guide and our code formatting rules.
2. **Documentation**: Ensure that all new features are accompanied by appropriate documentation.
3. **Commit Messages**: Write clear and concise commit messages that describe the changes made.
4. **Pull Requests**: Open a pull request from your feature branch to the `main` branch of the original repository.

## Reporting Issues

If you find a bug or have an idea for a new feature, please open an issue on the [GitHub issues page](https://github.com/Nueramarcos/vertex-sim-core/issues).

Thank you for contributing to Vertex-Sim-Core!
